Z||000013||rockcrawl||11-16-2001||11:15 PM||||No it doesn't. The tube on the front side (front of car) just needs clean air intake. A K&N breather is fine. The tube on the rear valve cover (trunk side) goes to manifold vacuum.||||reg||1
